; exceptions. The relational helpers (lt, le, gt, ge) raise invalid for any
; NaN, the eq, ne and unord helpers only for a signaling NaN. Quiet relational
; compares first check for unordered operands and compare +0.0 instead, and
; signaling compares that only use the quiet helpers also call the le helper.

